# Straight-line cartesian move, planned by the firmware (SDK Arm::move_l).
#
# Fails with a cartesian planning error when the line is not achievable (unreachable,
# through a limit, or collinear start/via). wait=false leaves the plan in flight for
# poll_cart. Refused unless allow_motion:=true.

float64[6] pose
float64 speed
bool wait
---
bool success
string message
bool settled
int32 err
int32 waypoints
uint32 plan_us
float64 settle_err_rad
float64[] q_final
